{"sourceUrl":"https://pharm.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgz/6182.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:28.691334+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://pharm.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgz/6182.html","html":"<div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  为进一步增进全国优秀大学生对上海交通大学药学院的了解，我院即将启动</span></span></span><span><span><span>暑期学术交流营</span></span></span><span><span><span>活动，诚邀有志于来学院深造的优秀学子报名参加，并鼓励同学们申请直博。本次学术交流营活动拟于2026年7月采用线下方式进行，具体安排请关注学校、学院后续通知。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>一、学院简介</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  上海交通大学药学院成立于2000年。拥有药学一级学科博士学位授权点、药学博士专业学位授权点、博士后流动站，2017年、2022年两次入选国家“双一流”建设学科。截止2025年，药理学和毒理学专业在US NEWS世界大学专业排名中位于第4位，QS学科排名第45名，ESI全球高校学科排名第15位（1.08 </span></span></span><span><span><span>‱</span></span></span><span><span><span>）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  药学院拥有创新免疫治疗全国重点实验室、细胞工程及抗体药物教育部工程研究中心、上海市药物靶标发现及递送前沿科学研究基地、上海市手性药物分子工程重点实验室、上海市创新靶标抗体偶联药物重点实验室等国家级和省部级平台。牵头建设上海交通大学生物医药前沿学院，打造教育科技人才一体化改革的集成特区，依托医学、药学、生物工程等顶尖学科，构建“基础-临床-产业”全链条创新体系。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>二、申请类别</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>申报类别</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学位类别</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>研究方向/领域</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>硕士生</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学术型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\">\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>药物化学</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>药理学</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>药剂学</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>微生物与生物技术药物学</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>药物分析学</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>生药学</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>智能药学</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span>8.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>临床药学（仅专业型）</span></span></span></b></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>专业型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>直博生</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学术型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>专业型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学/生物与医药</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>三、申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>纳入双一流建设的高校或学科、国家重点学科以及其它院校在校本科三年级优秀学生（2027年夏季毕业）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>学习成绩优异，本科前三年（或前五学期）总评成绩排名在专业前30%。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>英语水平良好，全国大学英语六级成绩≥425分或TOEFL≥90分或IELTS≥6.0分。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>对药学有浓厚的兴趣，并有志于药学专业领域深造，有较强的科研潜力。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>四、申请程序</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>报名时间：即日起至</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日上午8点</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>报名网址：</span></span></span> <u> </u><u><span><span><span>https://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl/default.aspx</span></span></span></u></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>填写申请信息，并按照研招网系统要求上传申请材料（<b>所有申请者需通过该系统报名申请，否则不予接收报名材料</b>）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>五、申请材料</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>暑期学术交流营</span></span></span><span><span><span>活动申请表<b>（报名系统中下载：</b></span></span></span><b><span><span><span>暑期学术交流营申请表；打印后需签字盖章扫描上传）</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>居民二代身份证（正反面扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>学生证（扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告（登录学信网：</span></span></span><a href=\"http://www.chsi.com.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>http://www.chsi.com.cn/</span></span></span></a><span><span><span>进入“学信档案”在线申请学籍验证）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单并加盖所在学校或学院教务部门公章，成绩单上应标明专业排名，若排名证明单独开具，请加盖学校或学院公章（扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>外语水平证明材料（如英语六级、托福、雅思等成绩单原件扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人简历</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>8.</span></span></span><span><span><span>其他材料（如已发表的论文或专利、与科研相关的获奖证书等原件扫描件，请合并成一个PDF文件上传，非必须项）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>9.</span></span></span><span><span><span>博士阶段研究计划书（仅申请推免直博生需填写）</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>注： </span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>关于系统上传材料的限制：身份证明，英语证明，成绩单等单一材料大小不超过5MB；发表论文或者获奖证明建议参加活动时自主携带纸质版，如的确有上传到系统的必要性，请限制在10-15MB。</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></b> <b><span><span><span>关于系统中本科期间发表论文、获奖情况栏目的填报：原则上仅限学生本科阶段在核心期刊上以独立作者或第一作者发表的与学业相关的科研论文；作为主力成员参加与学业相关的国内权威科研竞赛(全国赛)并获得三等奖以上奖励；学生与直系亲属或学历、职称、职务明显高于本人者合作的科研成果、竞赛奖项等仅作为参考，不纳入学生本人推免遴选综合评价成绩计算体系，同等条件下可优先考虑。</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>六、资格审查</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>报名截止后，由学院专门工作委员会根据申请者材料进行入围资格审查。入围者名单将于七月中下旬在上海交通大学研究生招生网公示，未入选者不再另行通知。活动具体安排将以电子邮件形式通知入围学生。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>七、其它事项</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本次活动为入选营员提供食宿，交通费用自理。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>报名时填报的所有信息和提供的辅助材料必须真实有效，如弄虚作假取消入围资格。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>活动正式开始后无极特殊原因不得迟到早退或中途请假离营，否则视为放弃参营资格。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>021-34206120</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:pharmacygrad@sjtu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>pharmacygrad@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：傅老师</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>上海交通大学药学院</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年6月</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"3aa45e828562497a269465563af53f21b62e4279ede2bafd3a82675f108b303b","textLength":1838,"sourceSha256":"21f7df1aaadf1afd177ee1341fc0c8edc55ef274fe15bab6a281e6926cf1612f","selector":".snr","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5f3818fb89aebf127f2c","title":"2026年上海交通大学药学院全国优秀大学生暑期学术交流营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:28.691334+00:00"}
